      "message": "Sure... But to be quite honest I don\u0027t get what the opportunistic flag is doing.\nLooks like it just quits early and doesn\u0027t make any connection attempt whatsoever? \n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/01c2d29eeefc2d344794429af3df08c38adfd57f:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/gatt/gatt_api.cc;l\u003d1471;drc\u003d01c2d29eeefc2d344794429af3df08c38adfd57f",
